# ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Cloud AI — Environment Configuration
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# AI Provider (optional — app runs in demo mode without it)
#
# To connect a real AI, set up a small backend proxy that holds your
# API key securely and exposes a POST /api/chat endpoint accepting
# { messages: [{role, content}] } and returning a streaming or JSON
# response. Then set the URL below.
#
# VITE_AI_API_URL=https://your-backend.example.com/api/chat
#
# Never put raw API keys (OpenAI, Anthropic, etc.) in frontend .env
# files — they are visible to anyone. Always proxy through a server.
#
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Demo mode is used automatically when VITE_AI_API_URL is not set.
